body.en:
Hello,

I am writing to request an employment verification letter for an immigration application. Could you please provide a signed letter on {{employerName}} letterhead that includes:

- My full name: {{fullName}}
- My job title: {{jobTitle}}
- My start date: {{startDate}}
- Whether I work full-time or part-time, and my current salary or hourly pay
- The name, title, and phone number of the person signing

A scanned PDF by email is fine. If possible, I would appreciate it within the next week.

Thank you very much for your help.

{{fullName}}
{{phone}}

