Hello,

I am a former student of {{schoolName}} and I need my records for an immigration application. Could you please send me:

- An official transcript, and
- A letter confirming my dates of attendance

My information:
Name while enrolled: {{fullName}}
Date of birth: {{dob}}
Years attended: {{schoolDates}}
Mailing address: {{address}}
Phone: {{phone}}

Please let me know if there is a form to fill out or a fee to pay.

Thank you,
{{fullName}}

